          "key": "vendor_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Qualified-person and applicable-requirements notice",
          "guidance": "Sign-in does not authorize boiler operation, isolation, setting changes, pressure-system work, fuel-train work, combustion adjustment, or return to service. Those actions require separate approval, qualified personnel, approved procedures, and review of applicable code, jurisdictional rules, site policy, and manufacturer requirements."
        }
